## Proposed Changes

### 1. Docker Configuration

File-file untuk containerize aplikasi Laravel agar bisa berjalan di Render.

---

#### [NEW] [Dockerfile](file:///c:/laragon/www/SIdispen%20(SMA%203)/backend-api/Dockerfile)

Membuat Dockerfile menggunakan base image `richarvey/nginx-php-fpm` yang sudah bundle Nginx + PHP-FPM, cocok untuk Laravel.

```dockerfile
FROM richarvey/nginx-php-fpm:3.1.6

# Copy project files
COPY . /var/www/html

# Set working directory
WORKDIR /var/www/html

# Image config
ENV SKIP_COMPOSER=1
ENV WEBROOT=/var/www/html/public
ENV PHP_ERRORS_ON=1
ENV RUN_SCRIPTS=1
ENV REAL_IP_HEADER=1

# Laravel config
ENV APP_ENV=production
ENV APP_DEBUG=false
ENV LOG_CHANNEL=stderr
ENV SESSION_DRIVER=cookie

# Allow composer to run as root
ENV COMPOSER_ALLOW_SUPERUSER=1

# Install composer dependencies (production only)
RUN composer install --no-dev --optimize-autoloader

# Create necessary directories and set permissions
RUN mkdir -p /var/www/html/storage/logs \
    && mkdir -p /var/www/html/storage/framework/sessions \
    && mkdir -p /var/www/html/storage/framework/views \
    && mkdir -p /var/www/html/storage/framework/cache \
    && mkdir -p /var/www/html/bootstrap/cache \
    && chown -R nginx:nginx /var/www/html/storage \
    && chown -R nginx:nginx /var/www/html/bootstrap/cache \
    && chmod -R 775 /var/www/html/storage \
    && chmod -R 775 /var/www/html/bootstrap/cache

# Copy startup script
COPY scripts/00-laravel-deploy.sh /var/www/html/scripts/00-laravel-deploy.sh
RUN chmod +x /var/www/html/scripts/00-laravel-deploy.sh
```

**Catatan:**
- `richarvey/nginx-php-fpm` secara otomatis menjalankan script di `/var/www/html/scripts/` saat startup
- `SKIP_COMPOSER=1` karena kita sudah menjalankan composer di build step
- `LOG_CHANNEL=stderr` agar logs terlihat di Render dashboard
- `SESSION_DRIVER=cookie` karena Render filesystem bersifat ephemeral (tidak persistent)

