### 2. Laravel Production Adjustments

Perubahan pada source code Laravel agar kompatibel dengan environment Render.

---

#### [MODIFY] [AppServiceProvider.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/SIdispen%20(SMA%203)/backend-api/app/Providers/AppServiceProvider.php)

Menambahkan **force HTTPS** di production karena Render menangani SSL/TLS di level proxy (termination). Tanpa ini, semua URL yang di-generate Laravel akan menggunakan `http://` dan menyebabkan mixed-content errors.

```diff
 <?php

 namespace App\Providers;

 use Illuminate\Support\ServiceProvider;
+use Illuminate\Support\Facades\URL;

 class AppServiceProvider extends ServiceProvider
 {
     public function register(): void
     {
         //
     }

     public function boot(): void
     {
+        // Force HTTPS in production (Render handles TLS termination)
+        if (config('app.env') === 'production') {
+            URL::forceScheme('https');
+        }
+
         \Dedoc\Scramble\Scramble::afterOpenApiGenerated(function (\Dedoc\Scramble\Support\Generator\OpenApi $openApi) {
             $openApi->secure(
                 \Dedoc\Scramble\Support\Generator\SecurityScheme::http('bearer')
             );
         });
     }
 }
```

---

#### [MODIFY] [config/app.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/SIdispen%20(SMA%203)/backend-api/config/app.php)

Menambahkan `trusted_proxies` config agar Laravel mengenali Render reverse proxy dan menghasilkan URL yang benar.

```diff
     'maintenance' => [
         'driver' => env('APP_MAINTENANCE_DRIVER', 'file'),
         'store' => env('APP_MAINTENANCE_STORE', 'database'),
     ],

+    /*
+    |--------------------------------------------------------------------------
+    | Trusted Proxies
+    |--------------------------------------------------------------------------
+    |
+    | Trust all proxies (Render uses reverse proxy for SSL termination)
+    |
+    */
+    'trusted_proxies' => '*',
+
 ];
```

> [!NOTE]
> Alternatif: Trusted proxy bisa juga dikonfigurasi via middleware di `bootstrap/app.php`. Pendekatan di `config/app.php` lebih simple untuk kasus Render yang selalu di-balik proxy.

