## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
# Lokal — verifikasi Dockerfile bisa build
docker build -t sidispen-api .

# Lokal — verifikasi container bisa start
docker run --rm -p 8080:80 --env-file .env sidispen-api

# Test health endpoint
curl http://localhost:8080/up
```

### Manual Verification (Setelah Deploy)
1. **Health Check:** Akses `https://<app>.onrender.com/up` → harus return 200 OK
2. **API Login:** `POST https://<app>.onrender.com/api/login` dengan credentials → harus return token
3. **Filament Admin:** Akses `https://<app>.onrender.com/admin` → harus tampil halaman login Filament
4. **API Docs:** Akses `https://<app>.onrender.com/docs/api` → harus tampil Scramble API documentation
5. **File Upload:** Test upload file via API → harus tersimpan di Supabase S3
6. **Push Notification:** Test kirim dispensasi → harus trigger Expo push notification
7. **Mobile App Connection:** Update `API_BASE_URL` di mobile app ke URL Render, test login dan semua fitur
